WEBVTT

00:09:59.746 --> 00:10:04.121
for escaping escalation of commitment.
But she didn't discover it overnight.

00:10:05.287 --> 00:10:08.329
She's been working at a software company
for a couple of years and

00:10:08.329 --> 00:10:10.662
for almost that entire time,
she was unhappy,

00:10:11.162 --> 00:10:15.746
but she couldn't bring herself to leave.
She started out with high hopes

00:10:15.871 --> 00:10:20.996
when I saw this job advertised.
I definitely felt like this.

00:10:20.996 --> 00:10:24.829
One hundred percent is my dream job.
The company was well respected.

00:10:24.871 --> 00:10:26.662
The benefits were amazing.

00:10:27.246 --> 00:10:31.162
This customer support job was perfect
for Janice, at least on paper.